# FactPPTv2 runs independently; leave unset when node is on PATH.
# Copy to runtime.env only when an override is needed. Never commit credentials.
# EASYPPT_NODE=C:\path\to\node.exe
# Default host is loopback; port is start.ps1 -Port 8001.
# Native ImageGen is called by Codex, not by this FastAPI process.
